Package: tamil-99-keyboard
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ibus, ibus-m17n, ibus-gtk, ibus-gtk3, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend
Description: Tamil 99 keyboard layout for IBus
 This package installs and configures the Tamil 99 keyboard layout
 for IBus input method framework. It automatically sets up the keyboard
 layout and configures the system to use it.
 .
 After installation, Tamil 99 keyboard will be available in your input
 method settings.

